Add a VideoToolbox H.264 decoder (macOS).

A new H.264 subsystem, h264_videotoolbox.c, decodes AVC420/AVC444 streams with the
system decoder (hardware on current Macs). Enabled with WITH_VIDEOTOOLBOX, on by
default on Apple platforms; it also turns on WITH_GFX_H264. Decoding only.

